{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53733","headline":"和元常侍晦除浙东留题越亭（题拟） · 路单","name":"和元常侍晦除浙东留题越亭（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢安致理逾三载，黄霸清声彻九重。\n犹辍佩环归凤阙，且将仁政到稽峰。\n林间立马罗千骑，池上开筵醉一钟。\n共喜甘棠有新咏，独惭霜鬓又攀龙。\n（《桂林风土记》）（按：《全唐诗》卷五四七收此诗，作者误爲路贯，今改正重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"路单","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}